    #      with a control, the date in each stem is matched as four, two and two
    #      digits so a sample whose name begins another's (edit, edit-formula)
    #      cannot match the other's records, and no other m3p1-scale- file may
    #      stand in the records directory. The status pattern allows the pairs.
    #  BW. The three shape greps read (yn|is|isnot|ynnot): P1's negative script
